fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gststructure.html#gst_structure_id_str_remove_field","fragment":"\n\tgst_structure_id_str_remove_field\n\n\n\tGst.Structure.prototype.id_str_remove_field\n\n\n\tGst.Structure.id_str_remove_field\n\nRemoves the field with the given name.  If the field with the given\nname does not exist, the structure is unchanged.\nParameters:\na GstStructure\nthe name of the field to remove\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nRemoves the field with the given name.  If the field with the given\nname does not exist, the structure is unchanged.\nParameters:\na Gst.Structure\nthe name of the field to remove\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nRemoves the field with the given name.  If the field with the given\nname does not exist, the structure is unchanged.\nParameters:\na Gst.Structure\nthe name of the field to remove\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});